WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.339
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.339 --> 00:00:06.440
Alternate universes are no excuse!

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.050
Theorists posit that there are an infinite
number of alternate universes out there, where

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.389
any amount of things could be possible.

00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:17.700
Unfortunately, that also implies that there
are an infinite number of Dr. Brights out

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.700
there.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.600
That doesn't mean, however, that Dr. Bright
can flout Foundation containment policy with

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.430
the excuse "there's an alternate universe
version of me that wouldn't do it."

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:31.800
There's probably a version of you that can
breathe underwater, but we don't see you doing

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:32.570
that.

